unacceptable at this time And frankly without a recommendation by the committee I think that other members of the council may feel the same This item that threatens to impact the people of Cheyenne in a very real way This ordinance if codified would create unnecessary financial burden on individuals in our community who have lost a loved one Please don't tax mourning There is enough grief with the loss of a loved one without the government creating more Many in our community use these memorials to remember loved ones who met a tragic end on our roadways Please remember these community members our friends and family tonight as you vote on this ordinance Don't allow for unnecessary government overreach Don't let them be forgotten because one or two members of our community wishes to dictate to hundreds of others how to mourn Save your yays for an ordinance that serves the people of Cheyenne better And

