even those who thought that they were a distraction when they were looked at like their road behaviors were not actually distracted And so there's this mental disconnect between the physical fact that it really is not actually a distraction Um uh there's also as as uh Mr Love mentioned there's not really any um significant complaints or issues that have occurred in the past um via city employees um being people actually hit visiting these roadside memorials They tend to be pretty safe because it's related to death and so there's a mental thing about being wary of it Um I know that there were discussions about alternative options Those cost money that a lot of times morning families do not have the opportunity to do it They cost time They cannot be put up immediately Uh

